        "text_wEnRWe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When you choose Kisco Candles, you’re not just getting products; you’re gaining a dedicated supplier who understands the heartbeat of your business. Here’s how we stand apart:</p>",
